biography.

00:03:49.362 --> 00:03:50.696
-Oh, my God.

00:03:50.696 --> 00:03:54.267
[ Southern accent ] What if I
said it with this accent?

00:03:54.267 --> 00:03:55.734
Uh...

00:03:55.734 --> 00:03:56.836
-Well, then I would think

00:03:56.836 --> 00:03:59.539
that it's probably
the best clue ever given

00:03:59.539 --> 00:04:01.407
