once again.

00:04:01.407 --> 00:04:03.175
And this is now
an uncomfortable moment.

00:04:03.175 --> 00:04:05.177
-[ Normal voice ] It was --
Chris Evans was wearing

00:04:05.177 --> 00:04:07.580
