and the movie was "Knives Out."

00:04:07.580 --> 00:04:10.382
-"Knives Out." And that is
probably a fantastic movie --

00:04:10.382 --> 00:04:12.684
and Chris Evans no doubtedly --

00:04:12.684 --> 00:04:15.788
and no doubtedly, Chris Evans
dazzled in that movie.

00:04:15.788 --> 00:04:17.389
-Final round, we're going
to put one second

00:04:17.389 --> 00:04:18.458
on the clock.
-Final round.

00:04:18.458 --> 00:04:19.691
-One second.

00:04:19.691 --> 00:04:22.995
You have to summarize the movie
in one second.

00:04:22.995 --> 00:04:25.264
Whenever you're ready.

00:04:25.264 --> 00:04:27.433
-Go. Dating, wine, California.

00:04:27.433 --> 00:04:28.934
[ Buzzer ]

00:04:28.934 --> 00:04:31.904
-Dating, wine, California.

00:04:31.971 --> 00:04:36.008
Dating, wine, California.

00:04:36.008 --> 00:04:38.744
Alright, so,
if I was dating somebody --

00:04:38.744 --> 00:04:41.013
It's like Sonoma --

00:04:41.013 --> 00:04:42.881
-You're putting yourself
in the moment.

00:04:42.881 --> 00:04:43.949
I like this.
-Yeah.

00:04:43.949 --> 00:04:46.352
Oh, is it "Eat Pray Love?"

00:04:46.352 --> 00:04:47.653
No -- Dating. Nope.

00:04:47.653 --> 00:04:49.288
That wasn't California.
That was Italy.

00:04:49.288 --> 00:04:51.890
Dating, wine --

00:04:51.890 --> 00:04:53.525
Is it the one
