00:05:00.333 --> 00:05:01.600
"Sideways."

00:05:01.600 --> 00:05:03.002
-"Sideways"!
-"Sideways."

00:05:03.002 --> 00:05:04.837
-Yes!
-Have you seen "Sideways"?

00:05:04.837 --> 00:05:07.006
-Yes, I did.
I saw "Sideways." Yes.

00:05:07.006 --> 00:05:09.108
We have one more shot at --

00:05:09.108 --> 00:05:11.544
-We have one more shot
